OL,3,ABurnham says UK net migration now under
OL,4,A'sufficient' control
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham said he believes there is
OL,7,Fnow a "sufficient degree of control" of
OL,8,Fnet migration in the UK after it fell
OL,9,Fto 77,000 in the year to the end of
OL,10,FJune.
OL,12,FThe prime minister said the country is
OL,13,F"getting into the position that the
OL,14,Fpublic has long wanted to see" but
OL,15,Fadded that there was more work to do.
OL,17,FThe Office for National Statistics
OL,18,F(ONS) said it is the lowest recorded
OL,19,Fnet migration estimate since 1997,
OL,20,Fexcluding the coronavirus pandemic.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
